meta {
  name: QR code exists
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/common/qrcode?qrcode_number=<qrcode>
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  qrcode_number: <qrcode>
}

docs {
  No login. Answers 400 `cannot generate qr code` unless the card is valid: its holder's request status is 15, or a request of type 2 (expired card) is running, whose Old card stays valid. A request of types 3-11 stops the Old card being valid as soon as it starts.
}
